      "iphone": "Settings > General > Transfer or Reset > Reset > Reset Network Settings > confirm.",
      "android": "Settings > System > Reset options > Reset Wi‑Fi, mobile & Bluetooth (or Reset network settings) > confirm.",
      "then": "After the reset, the phone will reboot automatically or prompt you to reboot. Wait 1 minute, confirm Data Roaming is ON and Mobile Data is ON, then test fast.com again."
    }
