  "thought_process": "Great—your network mode and data are now excellent (5G, strong signal, very fast). Since MMS still fails, the most common remaining causes are APN/MMSC configuration or the messaging app lacking required permissions. We’ll verify and fix those next.",
  "do_now_steps": [
