      "Tap the three dots ••• (or Menu) > Reset to default > Confirm.",
      "Restart your phone: hold the power button and tap Restart.",
      "After it restarts, repeat the MMS test above (with Wi‑Fi OFF)."
    ]
  },
  "request_update": "Please go through the steps and tell me what happens at each point — especially whether the picture message sends. I’m here and will adjust the steps if anything looks different on your screen."
}

