    "Roaming blocked (we enabled it on your line).",
    "Weak/slow network (you now have strong 5G).",
    "Wi‑Fi Calling/VPN/Data Saver interference (you turned those OFF).",
    "Incorrect APN/MMSC (you reset APN and rebooted)."
