        "Tap Permissions.",
        "Allow: SMS and Storage/Files & media (or Photos and videos). If any of these are set to Don’t allow, change them to Allow."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Refresh mobile data",
      "why": "Forces a clean data session before the next test.",
