  "after_signal_returns": [
    "With Wi‑Fi OFF, try loading a website to confirm mobile data works.",
    "Then try sending an MMS."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Being indoors or underground can cause No Signal. If possible, move near a window or outdoors during these steps.",
    "Seeing ‘Unable to connect’ on some operators is normal—just try the next one."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "What does your SIM status show (present/active, missing, or locked)?",
    "After setting 4G/5G preferred and trying manual selection, do you get any signal bars or a network name (e.g., Orange F, SFR, Bouygues, Free)? If so, which one?",
    "If manual selection fails on all networks, please confirm you’ve rebooted, and then we’ll proceed to reseat the SIM."
  ]
}

