      "how": [
        "Under eSIM/Cellular plans, look for your carrier’s plan entry.",
        "If you see a toggle like Use SIM/On-Off, make sure it is ON.",
        "Also ensure Mobile data is ON and Data roaming is ON for that plan."
      ],
      "what_to_observe": "Is a carrier plan listed? Is its toggle ON?"
    },
