      "why": "Refreshing the eSIM profile can restore detection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Refresh radios",
      "how": [
        "Turn Airplane Mode ON for 20 seconds, then OFF.",
        "If still no change, reboot the phone: power OFF, wait 20 seconds, power ON, and wait 2–3 minutes near a window/open area."
      ],
      "why": "Forces the device to reinitialize cellular and attempt registration."
    }
  ],
