  "message": "I can help you get MMS working. First, I need to identify your account so I can check your line’s status, data, and settings, then I’ll walk you through simple checks on your phone.",
  "why_i_need_info": "MMS relies on your line being active, mobile data being available, and correct settings (like APN/MMSC and Wi‑Fi Calling). Verifying your account lets me spot issues like suspension, data cap, or roaming settings.",
  "what_will_happen_next": [
    "I’ll check your line status, data usage/limits, and roaming settings on our side.",
    "Then I’ll guide you to quickly verify mobile data is on, airplane mode is off, and that MMS settings are correct on your phone."
  ],
  "requests": {
    "account_lookup": "Please share the phone number for the line that’s having MMS issues (best option). If you prefer, you can provide your Customer ID, or your full name and date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD).",
    "quick_context": [
      "Are regular text-only messages (SMS) sending/receiving correctly?",
      "Can you browse the internet using mobile data (turn Wi‑Fi off and try a website)?",
      "Are you currently traveling outside your usual area/country?",
      "Is your phone an iPhone or Android?"
    ]
  }
}

